<section id="manufacturers" style="background: #0E2F6B">
<div class="wrap sec" style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 64px; padding-top: 104px; padding-bottom: 104px">
<div style="flex: 1 1 480px; min-width: 0; max-width: 760px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8FC1FF">Trabajamos con fabricantes de EE. UU.</p>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 38px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: #FFFFFF">Véndale a un comprador directo que exporta su producto.</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #DCE6F5">Nos interesa establecer relaciones de compra directa con fabricantes y proveedores de todo Estados Unidos de América.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #DCE6F5">Buscamos relaciones comerciales a largo plazo basadas en la confiabilidad, los precios competitivos y el crecimiento mutuo.</p>
<p style="margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #C9D8EE">Nos interesa evaluar:</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 17px; color: #FFFFFF"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="#8FC1FF" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9"></path></svg>Nuevos productos</li><li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 17px; color: #FFFFFF"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="#8FC1FF" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9"></path></svg>Precios mayoristas</li><li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 17px; color: #FFFFFF"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="#8FC1FF" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9"></path></svg>Disponibilidad</li><li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 17px; color: #FFFFFF"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="#8FC1FF" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9"></path></svg>Condiciones de compra</li><li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 17px; color: #FFFFFF"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="#8FC1FF" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9"></path></svg>Posibilidades de exportación</li>
</ul>
<div style="padding-top: 12px"><a href="#contact" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 26px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FFFFFF; color: #0E2F6B">Presente sus productos</a></div>
</div>
<div class="mfr-photo" style="flex: 1 1 440px; min-width: 0">
<img class="media" src="{{BASE}}images/IMG-09.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" onerror="if(!this.dataset.f){this.dataset.f=1;this.src='{{BASE}}images/IMG-09.png'}else{this.parentNode.remove()}" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 480px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 6px">
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="mission">
<div class="wrap sec" style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 24px; padding-top: 112px; padding-bottom: 112px; text-align: center">
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #0B5FC4">Nuestra misión</p>
<p class="mission" style="margin: 0; max-width: 920px; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.4; color: #0E2F6B">Ampliar la comercialización internacional de productos fabricados en EE. UU. mediante operaciones de compra directa, reventa y exportación, conectando la producción estadounidense con los mercados en crecimiento de Argentina y Sudamérica.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section id="contact" style="background: #F2F6FB">
<div class="wrap sec" style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 64px; padding-top: 104px; padding-bottom: 104px">
<div style="flex: 1 1 380px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #0B5FC4">Contacto</p>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 38px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: #14213A">Póngase en contacto.</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3D4A60">Envíenos un mensaje y le responderemos.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding-top: 8px; font-size: 16px; color: #3D4A60">
<a href="mailto:juccallc@yahoo.com" style="font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline; padding: 10px 0; align-self: flex-start">juccallc@yahoo.com</a>
<span>Florida, EE. UU.</span>
</div>
</div>
<form id="contact-form" action="{{AJAX}}" method="POST" style="flex: 1 1 520px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9E2EE; border-radius: 8px; padding: 36px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; flex: 1 1 240px">
<label for="f-name" style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #14213A">Nombre completo</label>
<input id="f-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required placeholder="" style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; height: 48px; padding: 0 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 16px; color: #14213A; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #A9B8CC; border-radius: 6px">
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; flex: 1 1 240px">
<label for="f-company" style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #14213A">Empresa</label>
<input id="f-company" name="company" type="text" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="" style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; height: 48px; padding: 0 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 16px; color: #14213A; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #A9B8CC; border-radius: 6px">
</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; flex: 1 1 240px">
<label for="f-email" style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #14213A">Correo electrónico</label>
<input id="f-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="" style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; height: 48px; padding: 0 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 16px; color: #14213A; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #A9B8CC; border-radius: 6px">
</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
<label for="f-msg" style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #14213A">Mensaje</label>
<textarea id="f-msg" name="message" rows="5" required style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 16px; color: #14213A; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #A9B8CC; border-radius: 6px; resize: vertical"></textarea>
</div>
<div aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: -9999px; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden"><label for="f-website">Website</label><input id="f-website" type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div>
<input type="hidden" name="action" value="jucca_contact">
<p id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" style="margin: 0; min-height: 22px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #14213A"></p>
<button type="submit" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 26px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; align-self: flex-start; border: 0; background: #0B5FC4; color: #FFFFFF; cursor: pointer">Enviar mensaje</button>
</form>
</div>
</section>

<footer style="background: #0A2250">
<div class="wrap" style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px 40px; padding-top: 40px; padding-bottom: 40px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
<span style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: #FFFFFF">JUCCA LLC</span>
<span style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #C9D8EE">IMPORTACIÓN · EXPORTACIÓN · COMERCIO GLOBAL</span>
</div>
<span style="font-size: 14px; color: #C9D8EE">© 2026 JUCCA LLC. Florida, EE. UU.</span>
</div>
</footer>

</div>
<script>
(function () {
  var M = {"sending": "Enviando...", "ok": "Gracias. Su mensaje fue enviado.", "fail": "No se pudo enviar el mensaje. Escríbanos a juccallc@yahoo.com."};
  var header = document.querySelector(".site-header"), burger = document.querySelector("[data-burger]");
  function closeMenu() { header.classList.remove("open"); burger.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "false"); }
  burger.addEventListener("click", function () {
    var open = header.classList.toggle("open");
    burger.setAttribute("aria-expanded", open ? "true" : "false");
  });
  document.querySelectorAll("#site-nav a, .site-actions a").forEach(function (a) { a.addEventListener("click", closeMenu); });
  var form = document.getElementById("contact-form"), status = document.getElementById("form-status"), loadedAt = Date.now();
  form.addEventListener("submit", function (e) {
    e.preventDefault();
    var data = new FormData(form), elapsed = Date.now() - loadedAt;
    if (data.get("website") || elapsed < 3000) { status.textContent = M.ok; form.reset(); return; }
    data.append("elapsed", String(elapsed));
    data.append("lang", document.documentElement.lang === "es" ? "es" : "en");
    var btn = form.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
    btn.disabled = true; status.textContent = M.sending;
    fetch(form.getAttribute("action"), { method: "POST", headers: { Accept: "application/json" }, body: data, credentials: "same-origin" })
      .then(function (r) { return r.json().then(function (j) { return r.ok && j.success === true; }); })
      .then(function (ok) { status.textContent = ok ? M.ok : M.fail; if (ok) { form.reset(); loadedAt = Date.now(); } })
      .catch(function () { status.textContent = M.fail; })
      .then(function () { btn.disabled = false; });
  });
})();
</script>
</body>
